{
  "id": "u15-l03",
  "unit": "u15-describing",
  "title": "Colours",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**Colours are adjectives.** After the noun they need no verb: **আকাশ নীল** 'the sky is blue'. Before the noun they describe it: **লাল শাড়ি** 'a red sari'.\n\nAsk with **রং** 'colour': **এটার রং কী?** 'What colour is this?' **তোমার প্রিয় রং কী?** 'What's your favourite colour?'\n\n**হলুদ** is also turmeric, the yellow spice in almost every curry. 'Not' is **না**: **এই কলা হলুদ না, সবুজ** 'this banana isn't yellow, it's green'. You will also see the spelling **রঙ**.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "rong",
      "bn": "রং",
      "tr": "rong",
      "en": "colour",
      "notes": "এটার রং কী? 'What colour is this?' The spelling রঙ is also common, and রং becomes রঙ- before an ending (রঙের)."
    },
    {
      "id": "nil",
      "bn": "নীল",
      "tr": "nil",
      "en": "blue"
    },
